VERSION 0.1
DOMAIN software
INTENT ledger
GOAL
  keep the ledger reproducible
CLAIM ledger.integrity REQUIRED
  ENSURE the ledger limit is the reviewed value
INVARIANT ledger.frozen CRITICAL
  ENSURE the reviewed ledger file is untouched
VERIFY ledger.integrity
  USING ledger.integrity
VERIFY ledger.frozen
  USING ledger.audit
ACCEPT WHEN
  required_claims == VERIFIED
  AND critical_failures == 0
